---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="About" description="Senior Engineering Manager and tech lead with nearly 20 years in software, writing about AI, engineering craft, and leadership." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<p class="label">About</p>

			<blockquote>
				"The software engineering world is shifting — some of it is genuine, material change. Some of it is hype. Telling the difference is the hard part."
			</blockquote>

			<p>
				I'm Graham Jackson — a Senior Engineering Manager and tech lead at a Fortune 500 company, with nearly 20 years in software. I've spent most of that time building systems, leading teams, and trying to make good decisions under uncertainty.
			</p>

			<p>
				This blog is where I think out loud about what's actually changing and what isn't. I write about three things: <strong>AI and its real impact on software development</strong>, the <strong>craft of engineering</strong> — what it means to build things well — and <strong>engineering leadership</strong> at a time when the ground keeps shifting.
			</p>

			<p>
				I'm not here to sell optimism or pessimism. Just honest takes from someone in the middle of it.
			</p>

			<hr />

			<p class="personal">
				When he's not thinking about AI and engineering, Graham is watching hockey or being supervised by two Labrador Retrievers.
			</p>

			<div class="links">
				<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gjackson2013" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn →</a>
				<a href="https://github.com/gjackson12" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub →</a>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	main {
		width: 720px;
		max-width: calc(100% - 2em);
		margin: auto;
		padding: 3em 1em;
	}
	.label {
		font-size: 0.65rem;
		color: var(--accent);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.15em;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.personal {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-size: 0.9em;
	}
	.links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		font-size: 0.85em;
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}
	.links a {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.links a:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
</style>
